// Opening, writing and closing. Answers 1 on success.
//
// The three calls are three statements because fs_error reads state the failing
// one set, and operands of a single expression are not ordered -- the backend's
// README is explicit about it, having been caught by exactly that.

ed_wput(string path, int[] buf) {
  int h = fs_open(path, "w");
  int n = ed_wnow(h, buf);
  int ret_i = n = len(buf);
} return int ret_i;
